{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q21", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主在哪一年登记结婚？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字辛亥 壬辰 丁卯 戊申，男命丁火日主，妻星为金（申为正财，辛为偏财），妻宫为卯木。大运逆排，命主约2岁4个月起运，1993年至2003年行己丑大运（食神运）。己丑运土旺生金，有利婚恋。\n\n结婚应期重点看妻星与妻宫的引动：\n- 1998年戊寅，寅申相冲震动妻星，但伤官透干，冲中带变，非最稳之象。\n- 1999年己卯，妻宫卯木重现（伏吟），是为婚姻宫正应，且卯申暗合，妻星与妻宫感应强烈；天干己土食神生财，主有缔结婚姻之喜，信息最为明确。\n- 2002年壬午，午卯相破，不利婚宫。\n- 2003年癸未，亥卯未合动妻宫，但该年入戊子大运，子卯刑伤妻宫，且大运伤官透出，不宜作为初婚之年。\n\n综合分析，1999年妻宫伏吟且与妻星暗合，是结婚的典型征象。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19710412_P005-Q21", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P2_G2\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 40913, "response_id": "c28e9d04-6979-4d42-8c61-6b57a3b6905c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 2779, "total_tokens": 2984, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2499}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 77}}
{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q22", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主在哪一年登记离婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "首先，分析命主八字：丁火日主，生于辰月，土旺火晦，喜木火生扶。妻宫卯木为用神，生助日主。月干壬水正官合身，丁壬合，主早年感情缘分，但官星为忌，易受制约。\n\n观察大运：命主2010年39岁，行戊子大运（32-42岁），子水与妻宫卯木相刑，为无礼之刑，婚姻已伏隐患。但2010庚寅年，流年寅木暗合妻宫卯木，且寅申冲在子女宫，与婚姻宫直接冲击不大，虽有波折但不致离婚。\n\n2017年入丁亥大运（42-52岁），亥水助原局亥卯半合木局，生旺日主。然2017丁酉流年，太岁酉金直冲妻宫卯木，卯酉冲破木局，且酉金为偏财，财星坐刃冲克用神妻宫，比肩透干争夺，主感情剧烈变动、分道扬镳之象，离婚信号极强。\n\n2018戊戌年，卯戌合火，合动妻宫，或有修复或新情缘，但变动之烈不如冲击。综合判断，2017年卯酉冲为典型婚变应期。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19710412_P005-Q22", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P2_G2\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 21004, "response_id": "888539d3-5ba6-42e5-8a64-adc46116a0e4", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 1460, "total_tokens": 1665, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1159}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 77}}
